<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan one-month NCDs yield average 6.093 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan one-month NCDs yield average 6.093 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank on Monday issued T$5 billion in one-month negotiable certificates of deposits at an average yield of 6.093 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>Yields ranged between 6.070 and 6.100 percent. Demand totalled T$9 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
